  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n** k⁴+(1)/(k⁴)=194**\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n (a+(1)/(a))²= a²+(1)/(a²) + 2\n\nIf \n\n (a+(1)/(a))=b\n\nThen,\n\n a³+(1)/(a³) =b³-3b\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n k⁴+(1)/(k⁴)=194\n\n⇒ k⁴+(1)/(k⁴)+2=194+2\n\n⇒ k⁴+(1)/(k⁴)+2=196\n\n⇒ ( k²+(1)/(k²))²=14²\n\n⇒ k²+(1)/(k²)=14\n\n⇒ k²+(1)/(k²)+2=14+2\n\n⇒ (k+(1)/(k))²=16\n\n⇒ </span&",
